{"seq":2,"slug":"anti-patterns","title":"反模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/practice/anti-patterns","wordCount":1287,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"反模式\">反模式</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>DI 反模式是那些表面上使用了依赖注入技术，实则违背了 DI 核心原则的代码结构。最常见的四种反模式是：Service Locator（把容器当全局字典，隐藏依赖关系）、Captive Dependency（长生命周期俘获短生命周期，导致资源泄漏）、Control Freak（在业务代码中直接 new 出易变依赖）、Ambient Context（用静态属性隐式传递依赖）。每种反模式的修复路径最终都指向同一方向——将隐式依赖变为显式构造器参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"service-locator-反模式\">Service Locator 反模式</h2><p>Service Locator 是 DI 最常见的对立面——它把 IoC 容器当作全局字典使用，让业务代码直接从容器中&quot;拉取&quot;依赖，而非通过构造函数&quot;接收&quot;依赖。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// Service Locator 反模式&#10;public class OrderService&#10;{&#10;    public Order CreateOrder(Cart cart)&#10;    {&#10;        // 业务代码直接依赖容器 API&#10;        var repo = ServiceLocator.GetService&lt;IOrderRepository&gt;();&#10;        var pricing = ServiceLocator.GetService&lt;IPricingEngine&gt;();&#10;&#10;        Money total = pricing.Calculate(cart);&#10;        return repo.Save(new Order(cart, total));&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Service Locator 反模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class OrderService</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public Order CreateOrder(Cart cart)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 业务代码直接依赖容器 API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var repo = ServiceLocator.GetService&#x3C;IOrderRepository>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var pricing = ServiceLocator.GetService&#x3C;IPricingEngine>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Money total = pricing.Calculate(cart);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return repo.Save(new Order(cart, total));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>为什么是反模式</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题维度</th>\n<th>Service Locator 的缺陷</th>\n<th>构造器注入的优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>依赖可见性</td>\n<td>隐藏在方法体内，需阅读实现才能知道</td>\n<td>构造函数签名即完整依赖清单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译期安全</td>\n<td>缺少注册只在运行时发现</td>\n<td>缺少参数编译不通过</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可测试性</td>\n<td>需 Mock 静态 ServiceLocator</td>\n<td>直接 new + Mock 参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IDE 支持</td>\n<td>无法通过&quot;Find Usages&quot;追踪依赖关系</td>\n<td>IDE 可追踪构造参数引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拒绝原则</td>\n<td>一个类可以随时增加新依赖而不改签名</td>\n<td>增加依赖 = 增加参数 = 审查信号</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph &quot;Service Locator 的问题&quot;&#10;        SL[ServiceLocator.Get] --&gt; Hidden[依赖隐藏]&#10;        SL --&gt; Runtime[运行时失败]&#10;        SL --&gt; Hard[难以测试]&#10;        SL --&gt; Leak[容器引用泄漏到业务层]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;构造器注入的解决&quot;&#10;        CI[Constructor Injection] --&gt; Visible[依赖显式]&#10;        CI --&gt; Compile[编译期检查]&#10;        CI --&gt; Easy[易于测试]&#10;        CI --&gt; Clean[业务代码无容器依赖]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph \"Service Locator 的问题\"\n        SL[ServiceLocator.Get] --&gt; Hidden[依赖隐藏]\n        SL --&gt; Runtime[运行时失败]\n        SL --&gt; Hard[难以测试]\n        SL --&gt; Leak[容器引用泄漏到业务层]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"构造器注入的解决\"\n        CI[Constructor Injection] --&gt; Visible[依赖显式]\n        CI --&gt; Compile[编译期检查]\n        CI --&gt; Easy[易于测试]\n        CI --&gt; Clean[业务代码无容器依赖]\n    end</pre><p><strong>唯一合理的 Service Locator 使用场景</strong>：框架级代码中，当无法通过构造器注入获取依赖时（如 ASP.NET Core 的 Middleware 构造函数在应用启动时执行，但某些服务需要在请求时才解析）。此时应使用方法注入（<code>Invoke</code> 方法参数）或 <code>HttpContext.RequestServices</code> 获取 Scoped 服务。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"captive-dependency-俘获依赖\">Captive Dependency（俘获依赖）</h2><p>Captive Dependency 是长生命周期服务持有短生命周期服务引用的问题——短生命周期服务被&quot;俘获&quot;，实际寿命被非预期地延长。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant App as 应用启动&#10;    participant Container as 容器&#10;    participant Singleton as SingletonService&#10;    participant Scoped as ScopedDbContext&#10;&#10;    App-&gt;&gt;Container: 解析 SingletonService&#10;    Container-&gt;&gt;Scoped: 创建 DbContext(本应 per-request)&#10;    Container-&gt;&gt;Singleton: new SingletonService(dbContext)&#10;    Note over Singleton,Scoped: DbContext 被俘获为 Singleton!&#10;&#10;    Note over Singleton: Request 1&#10;    Singleton-&gt;&gt;Scoped: 使用同一个 DbContext&#10;    Note over Singleton: Request 2&#10;    Singleton-&gt;&gt;Scoped: 仍然是同一个 DbContext!&#10;    Note over Scoped: 连接不释放,ChangeTracker 膨胀\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant App as 应用启动\n    participant Container as 容器\n    participant Singleton as SingletonService\n    participant Scoped as ScopedDbContext\n\n    App-&gt;&gt;Container: 解析 SingletonService\n    Container-&gt;&gt;Scoped: 创建 DbContext(本应 per-request)\n    Container-&gt;&gt;Singleton: new SingletonService(dbContext)\n    Note over Singleton,Scoped: DbContext 被俘获为 Singleton!\n\n    Note over Singleton: Request 1\n    Singleton-&gt;&gt;Scoped: 使用同一个 DbContext\n    Note over Singleton: Request 2\n    Singleton-&gt;&gt;Scoped: 仍然是同一个 DbContext!\n    Note over Scoped: 连接不释放,ChangeTracker 膨胀</pre><p><strong>后果清单</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>严重性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内存泄漏</td>\n<td>Change Tracker 无限累积实体</td>\n<td>高——最终 OOM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据过期</td>\n<td>读到的是启动时的缓存数据</td>\n<td>高——业务逻辑错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接耗尽</td>\n<td>数据库连接永不归还连接池</td>\n<td>高——服务不可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线程安全</td>\n<td>DbContext 非线程安全被并发访问</td>\n<td>高——数据损坏</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>检测与防护</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>.NET：<code>ValidateScopes = true</code>（Development 环境默认开启）</li>\n<li>Spring：<code>@Scope(&quot;prototype&quot;)</code> 的 Bean 注入到 Singleton 中会有 WARN 日志（需手动启用检测）</li>\n<li>代码审查：Singleton 服务的构造参数中出现 Scoped 类型 = 必须修复</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"god-container-上帝容器\">God Container（上帝容器）</h2><p>God Container 指将应用中所有服务无差别地注册到一个扁平的全局容器中，没有模块化组织：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// God Container：数百行无结构的注册&#10;services.AddScoped&lt;IOrderService, OrderService&gt;();&#10;services.AddScoped&lt;IOrderRepository, SqlOrderRepository&gt;();&#10;services.AddScoped&lt;IOrderValidator, OrderValidator&gt;();&#10;services.AddScoped&lt;IPaymentService, PaymentService&gt;();&#10;services.AddScoped&lt;IPaymentGateway, StripeGateway&gt;();&#10;services.AddScoped&lt;IUserService, UserService&gt;();&#10;services.AddScoped&lt;IEmailSender, SmtpEmailSender&gt;();&#10;// ... 还有 200 行 ...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// God Container：数百行无结构的注册</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>services.AddScoped&#x3C;IOrderService, OrderService>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>services.AddScoped&#x3C;IOrderRepository, SqlOrderRepository>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>services.AddScoped&#x3C;IOrderValidator, OrderValidator>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>services.AddScoped&#x3C;IPaymentService, PaymentService>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>services.AddScoped&#x3C;IPaymentGateway, StripeGateway>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>services.AddScoped&#x3C;IUserService, UserService>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>services.AddScoped&#x3C;IEmailSender, SmtpEmailSender>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ... 还有 200 行 ...</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>问题</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有服务相互可见，无法通过 DI 层面限制访问</li>\n<li>注册文件成为合并冲突热点</li>\n<li>新开发者无法快速理解服务的归属和边界</li>\n<li>删除一个模块时不知道哪些注册该一起删</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>修复</strong>：按模块拆分为独立的注册方法，每个方法只注册一个模块的服务，并明确导出接口（参见模块边界章节）。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"control-freak-控制狂\">Control Freak（控制狂）</h2><p>Control Freak 指在业务代码中直接 <code>new</code> 出易变依赖（Volatile Dependency）——即那些有外部副作用、需要被替换或被 Mock 的依赖：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// Control Freak：在业务代码中 new 出易变依赖&#10;public class ReportGenerator {&#10;    public Report generate(ReportSpec spec) {&#10;        // 直接 new —— 无法替换、无法 Mock&#10;        var dataSource = new PostgresDataSource(&quot;jdbc:postgres://prod:5432/db&quot;);&#10;        var formatter = new PdfFormatter(new FileOutputStream(&quot;/tmp/report.pdf&quot;));&#10;&#10;        var data = dataSource.query(spec.sql());&#10;        return formatter.format(data);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Control Freak：在业务代码中 new 出易变依赖</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReportGenerator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Report </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">generate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ReportSpec </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 直接 new —— 无法替换、无法 Mock</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataSource </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PostgresDataSource</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"jdbc:postgres://prod:5432/db\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> formatter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PdfFormatter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FileOutputStream</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/tmp/report.pdf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataSource.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">query</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(spec.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sql</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> formatter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>判断标准</strong>：哪些对象可以直接 <code>new</code>、哪些必须注入？</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>可以直接 new（Stable Dependency）</th>\n<th>必须通过 DI 注入（Volatile Dependency）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>值对象：Money, Address, DateRange</td>\n<td>数据库访问：Repository, DbContext</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集合：ArrayList, HashMap</td>\n<td>外部服务调用：HttpClient, Gateway</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DTO/POJO：RequestDto, ResponseVo</td>\n<td>文件系统操作：FileWriter, Storage</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纯计算工具：MathUtils, StringHelper</td>\n<td>时间提供者：Clock, DateTimeProvider</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Builder 模式中间产物</td>\n<td>随机数/ID 生成器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"ambient-context-环境上下文\">Ambient Context（环境上下文）</h2><p>Ambient Context 使用静态属性或 ThreadLocal 来隐式传递依赖，表面上避免了参数传递，实则引入了隐藏的全局状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// Ambient Context 反模式&#10;public static class TimeProvider&#10;{&#10;    // 静态属性——隐式全局状态&#10;    public static Func&lt;DateTime&gt; Current { get; set; } = () =&gt; DateTime.UtcNow;&#10;}&#10;&#10;public class OrderService&#10;{&#10;    public Order CreateOrder(Cart cart)&#10;    {&#10;        // 隐式依赖于全局 TimeProvider&#10;        var createdAt = TimeProvider.Current();&#10;        return new Order(cart, createdAt);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Ambient Context 反模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public static class TimeProvider</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 静态属性——隐式全局状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public static Func&#x3C;DateTime> Current { get; set; } = () => DateTime.UtcNow;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class OrderService</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public Order CreateOrder(Cart cart)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 隐式依赖于全局 TimeProvider</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var createdAt = TimeProvider.Current();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return new Order(cart, createdAt);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>问题</strong>：测试中修改 <code>TimeProvider.Current</code> 会影响并行运行的其他测试；依赖关系不在构造函数中可见；忘记重置会导致后续测试失败。</p>\n<p><strong>正确方案</strong>：将 <code>IClock</code> 作为显式依赖注入：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class OrderService&#10;{&#10;    private readonly IClock _clock;&#10;&#10;    public OrderService(IOrderRepository repo, IClock clock)&#10;    {&#10;        _clock = clock;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public Order CreateOrder(Cart cart)&#10;    {&#10;        var createdAt = _clock.UtcNow(); // 显式依赖，可测试&#10;        return new Order(cart, createdAt);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class OrderService</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private readonly IClock _clock;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public OrderService(IOrderRepository repo, IClock clock)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _clock = clock;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public Order CreateOrder(Cart cart)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var createdAt = _clock.UtcNow(); // 显式依赖，可测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return new Order(cart, createdAt);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"反模式识别速查表\">反模式识别速查表</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    Code[审查代码] --&gt; Q1{业务类中出现 container.Get/Resolve?}&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|是| SL[Service Locator → 改为构造器注入]&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|否| Q2{Singleton 构造参数包含 Scoped 类型?}&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|是| CD[Captive Dependency → 注入 Factory/Scope]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|否| Q3{业务类中 new 出有副作用的对象?}&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|是| CF[Control Freak → 提取接口并注入]&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|否| Q4{使用静态属性传递可变依赖?}&#10;    Q4 --&gt;|是| AC[Ambient Context → 改为构造器注入]&#10;    Q4 --&gt;|否| OK[暂无明显反模式]\">graph TB\n    Code[审查代码] --&gt; Q1{业务类中出现 container.Get/Resolve?}\n    Q1 --&gt;|是| SL[Service Locator → 改为构造器注入]\n    Q1 --&gt;|否| Q2{Singleton 构造参数包含 Scoped 类型?}\n    Q2 --&gt;|是| CD[Captive Dependency → 注入 Factory/Scope]\n    Q2 --&gt;|否| Q3{业务类中 new 出有副作用的对象?}\n    Q3 --&gt;|是| CF[Control Freak → 提取接口并注入]\n    Q3 --&gt;|否| Q4{使用静态属性传递可变依赖?}\n    Q4 --&gt;|是| AC[Ambient Context → 改为构造器注入]\n    Q4 --&gt;|否| OK[暂无明显反模式]</pre><p>每种反模式的修复路径最终都指向同一个方向：<strong>将隐式的依赖关系变为显式的构造器参数，将对象创建逻辑收敛到 Composition Root</strong>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>四种 DI 反模式的共同本质是：将本应显式的依赖关系变为隐式——要么隐藏在方法体中（Service Locator）、要么隐藏在生命周期错配中（Captive Dependency）、要么隐藏在 new 调用中（Control Freak）、要么隐藏在静态属性中（Ambient Context）。识别信号统一为&quot;构造函数不能完整表达类的依赖关系&quot;。修复方向也统一为&quot;将隐式依赖提升为显式构造器参数，将对象创建逻辑收敛到 Composition Root&quot;。在代码审查中建立对这四种模式的敏感度，是保持 DI 架构健康的关键纪律。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><em>相关文档：<a href=\"testability-mocking\">可测试性与 Mock</a> 展示正确 DI 实践如何支撑高效的单元测试。</em></p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"反模式","id":"反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Service Locator 反模式","id":"service-locator-反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"Captive Dependency（俘获依赖）","id":"captive-dependency-俘获依赖"},{"level":2,"text":"God Container（上帝容器）","id":"god-container-上帝容器"},{"level":2,"text":"Control Freak（控制狂）","id":"control-freak-控制狂"},{"level":2,"text":"Ambient Context（环境上下文）","id":"ambient-context-环境上下文"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式识别速查表","id":"反模式识别速查表"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"可测试性与 Mock","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/practice/testability-mocking"},"next":{"title":"迁移策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/dependency-injection-ioc/practice/migration-strategy"}}